</ul></div><div id="integration-id-d2cdbac" class=""><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0">Once a trade has been executed, broker-dealers can choose to clear trades through Automated Confirmation Transaction Service SM (ACTSM) or through Qualified Special Representative (QSR).</p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"></p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0">New subscribers are prohibited from placing any orders into Global OTC prior to finalizing the required documentation.</p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"></p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0">Fair Access Standards:</p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0">a. Applicant must be a FINRA Registered Broker-Dealer</p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0">b. Applicant must complete GOTC Subscriber Agreement</p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0"></p><p class="print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 print:text-black mb-6 last:mb-0">For questions pertaining to becoming a Global OTC Subscriber, please contact Client Relationship Services at 212.896.2803 or <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ddb4b3bbb29dbab1b2bfbcb1b2a9bef3beb2b0f3" class="text-left no-underline hover:underline cursor-pointer print:text-black print:underline text-secondary hover:text-secondary font-bold inline [&amp;_svg]:inline"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f891969e97b89f94979a9994978c9bd69b9795">[email&#160;protected]</span>.</a></p></div></div><div style="overflow-x:auto;grid-column:span 3"><div data-partial="/side-nav"><div class="contents globalotc"><div><div class="row callout-row">
  <div class="callout callout-full">
